<title>PERU: Southern says in deal with Belgium's Powerfin.</title>
<headline>Southern says in deal with Belgium's Powerfin.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copper miner Southern Peru Ltd said Thursday it has reached an agreement to sell a power plant and purchase electrical energy from Belgium's Powerfin SA.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Southern, a unit of U.S.-based ASARCO Inc, said an accord had not been signed yet but that it reached an agreement with Powerfin's local unit to sell its Ilo electrical generator.</p>
<p>The accord also calls for Powerfin to supply Southern with power for 20 years, he said.</p>
</text>
